Package: SIECCLongWeather
Type: Package
Title: Reproduce the SIECC Israel Long-Term Weather Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Nahum M.", "Gabinet", email = "ngabinet@campus.haifa.ac.il",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5861-1507"))
Description: Reviewer-facing R implementation and reproducibility package for
    the validated six-metric Israel long-term weather analysis covering annual
    1950--2025 and December--February 1950/51--2024/25. It implements the
    validated temporal, spatial, statistical, figure, table, traceability, and
    publication-validation mathematics while preserving the historical
    R/Python hybrid production lineage.
